  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When viewing a group page in-game, there are stylization inconsistencies compared to the website.\n\n1.) It's currently (to my knowledge), not possible to block or unblock a group in-game from their groups page directly, while both are possible on the website.\n\n2.) After blocking a group, the website blacks out their icon and banner somewhat, it also hides the description, rules and other information. The in-game group page doesn't do any of this.\n\n3.) After blocking a group, helpful information, describing exactly what blocking the group does is shown on the website. The in-game group page doesn't do any of this.\n\nAll of these are helpful and these stylistic changes should be brought over in-game, much like user profiles recently were.",
